@startuml
!include skin.iuml
hide empty description
[*] --> Loaded : line read from file
Loaded --> Normalized : free text accepted\nafter LLM rewrite
Loaded --> Valid : validation passed
Loaded --> Invalid : validation failed /\nnormalization failed or rejected
Normalized --> Valid : validation passed
Normalized --> Invalid : validation failed
Valid --> Translated : scenarios generated
Invalid --> [*] : session ends
Translated --> [*] : session ends
note right of Invalid : listed in the Error Report\n(corrected in the file and\nloaded again in a new session)
@enduml
